{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/372890/extras/fbc83f56c44847506c9615398a68c8ef.avif?t=1764329477\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shadows of Red Crow Mysteries: Legion, a dark hidden-object adventure filled with puzzles, mystery, and supernatural secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your special gift allows you to see beyond the veil of reality \u2014 but that gift comes at a price. The Legion is waiting. Are you ready to face it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And as you step outside, just to learn that nothing is the same anymore, you will search for clues, investigate surroundings, explore many different locations and seeks for helpful hidden objects and items. But beware, a man in a fine suite and with the friendly smile is not who he truly is. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/372890/extras/e12df74d49c83c2c80d6e0a9962cb16b.avif?t=1764329477\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>\ud83d\udd0e Hidden Object &amp; Puzzle Adventure \u2013 investigate\u00a0 scenes and solve mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Dozens of locations &amp; mini-games \u2013 mystery lurks from every dark corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Map &amp; Journal \u2013 always know where to go next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 Full voiceovers &amp; HD visuals \u2013 immerse yourself in the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f 3 difficulty levels \u2013 from relaxed exploration to true challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf4 Play completely offline \u2014 anytime, anywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd12 No data collection \u2014 your privacy is safe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79 Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click / Tap to search scenes, collect clues, combine items from your inventory, and complete mini-games to progress the story. Use hints if you get stuck \u2014 but the reward is uncovering more of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Play your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, investigate and solve the mystery in your own way: adjustable challenge: Casual, Adventure, and Challenging difficulty modes. Win Achievements &amp; Collectibles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c Atmospheric adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gripping mystery: narrative-driven gameplay with a strong detective lead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive locations: explore, seeks, search and solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/372890/extras/02555f5fbc5e626b0a361c2a8941025a.avif?t=1764329477\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > INVESTIGATE strange occurrences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > EXPLORE dozens of unique eerie locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > FIND clues and items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > SEARCH for helpful hidden objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > CONFRONT the Legion and save your soul</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > SOLVE many different mini-games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > EARN achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3 DIFFICULTY MODES: casual, adventure, challenging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > TUTORIAL for beginners</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Special Rose","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/372890/e16426121a58